    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Executive Summary'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#2c3e50' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='36'>Executive Overview</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f6fa' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-title'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f5f5' />
          <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
          <format attr='border-color' value='#e0e0e0' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-subtitle'>
          <format attr='color' value='#2c3e50' />
          <format attr='font-size' value='14' />
          <format attr='font-family' value='Calibri' />
          <format attr='font-weight' value='bold' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
          <format attr='vertical-align' value='center' />
          <format attr='color' value='#2c3e50' />
          <format attr='font-size' value='14' />
          <format attr='font-family' value='Calibri' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='97342' id='150' type-v2='text' w='88287' x='9703' y='2658'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='22'>Executive Summary &amp; Key Insights</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='22'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>1. High Overall Readmission Rate</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>The hospital recorded an average readmission rate of 77.3%, exceeding the chronic-care benchmark range (65–75%).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>This indicates potential gaps in post-discharge monitoring and patient follow-up care. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>2. Medicare Patients Showed the Highest Readmission Rates</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Medicare patients experienced the highest readmission rate at 95.4%. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>This may reflect the vulnerability of elderly and chronic-condition patients. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>3. Certain Diagnoses Were Associated with Elevated Risk</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>COPD, Sepsis, and Heart Failure showed the highest readmission percentages. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>These conditions may require enhanced discharge planning and closer outpatient monitoring. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>4. Longer Hospital Stays Correlated with Higher Complexity</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Patients with severe comorbidities and diagnoses such as Sepsis and Stroke exhibited longer average lengths of stay. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>This suggests increased treatment complexity and resource utilization. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>5. Discharge Disposition Strongly Influenced Outcomes</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Skilled Nursing and Home Health groups demonstrated notably high percentages across older age groups. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>This highlights the importance of post-discharge care pathways in reducing readmissions. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>6. Seasonal Variation Was Relatively Stable</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>Monthly readmission rates remained consistently high throughout the year, with slight increases toward December. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial' fontsize='11'>The trend suggests systemic operational factors rather than isolated seasonal spikes. </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='149502' id='375' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='6506' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='background-color' value='#46546b' />
